  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">6 Megawatt Hihifo Solar Power Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In October 2018, Tonga Power Limited (TPL) solicited tenders for the design, fabrication, delivery, installation, operation and maintenance of a 6 megawatt (MW) ground-mounted grid interconnected solar photovoltaic (PV) system over three sites of 2MW each in Tongatapu under a Power Purchase Agreement (PPA) with TPL (the Project). TPL will provide the land suitable for PV installation and secure all sites, permits and approvals from government agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
